* Behavioural op-amps for tests: 5 pins in+ in- V+ V- out, single pole, output clamped
* to the rails. Written in plain SPICE so LTspice and ngspice both run them.
.subckt TOA1 inp inn vp vn out
Rin inp inn 10Meg
G1 0 a inp inn 1m
Ra a 0 100Meg
Ca a 0 15.9n
E1 b 0 a 0 1
Ro b out 50
.ends TOA1
.subckt TOA10 inp inn vp vn out params: gbw=10Meg
Rin inp inn 10Meg
G1 0 a inp inn 1m
Ra a 0 100Meg
Ca a 0 15.9p
E1 b 0 a 0 1
Ro b out 50
.ends TOA10
